# Infer: InFact.IndexCart
# When: store `f $in index_cart(I, S, g)`.
# Infers: `f $in fn(alpha I) family_union(S)` and `$is_choice_function_for(I, S, g, f)`.
# Run: litex -f examples/infer/atomic/in_index_cart.lit

have fn g(k {1}) {{1}} = {1}
forall f index_cart({1}, {{1}}, g):
    f $in fn(alpha {1}) family_union({{1}})
    $is_choice_function_for({1}, {{1}}, g, f)
